Grammar

    0 $accept: program $end

    1 program: /* empty */
    2        | program statement

    3 statement: declaration_stmt
    4          | assignment_stmt
    5          | expression SEMICOLON

    6 declaration_stmt: type IDENTIFIER SEMICOLON
    7                 | CONST type IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expression SEMICOLON
    8                 | type IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expression SEMICOLON

    9 type: INT
   10     | FLOAT_TYPE
   11     | STRING_TYPE
   12     | CHAR_TYPE

   13 assignment_stmt: IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expression SEMICOLON

   14 expression: expression PLUS T
   15           | expression MINUS T
   16           | T

   17 T: T MULTIPLY F
   18  | T DIVIDE F
   19  | T MODULO F
   20  | F

   21 F: LPAREN expression RPAREN
   22  | MINUS F
   23  | IDENTIFIER
   24  | FLOAT
   25  | NUMBER


